OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA day of variable cloud and
OL,6,Fbright spells with more frequent
OL,7,Fshowers, some on the heavy side, best
OL,8,Fof the brighter spells towards
OL,9,FInverbervie and the east coast. Fresh
OL,10,Fto strong westerly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FQuite cloudy with scattered
OL,13,Fshowers at first, these largely fading
OL,14,Fout through the evening and overnight
OL,15,Fto allow clear spells to develop. The
OL,16,Fodd shower persisting towards
OL,17,FFraserburgh and Peterhead.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
