OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA few light showers around
OL,6,FFraserburgh and Peterhead at first.
OL,7,FOtherwise a dry day with sunny spells
OL,8,Fand light winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,11,FCloudier Monday with patchy rain.
OL,12,FEarly rain clearing Tuesday morning
OL,13,Fthen sunshine and showers, windy at
OL,14,Ftimes. Windy on Wednesday with bright
OL,15,Fspells, variable cloud and some
OL,16,Foutbreaks of rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
